    <div class="lux-brand-news-sheet"><header><p class="lux-brand-news-meta"><span>August 27, 2026</span><span>Event Preview</span><span>ITAGuangzhou</span></p><h1 id="lux-reader-title">Italian National Pavilion Makes Its Debut at Marca China 2026 with 10 Italian Companies</h1><p class="lux-brand-news-intro">The Italian Trade Agency will participate with an official Italian National Pavilion for the first time, bringing 10 Italian companies to Marca China 2026. LuxurEat will be at Booth 1D04.</p><a class="lux-brand-news-source" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/AaAbA-tySlYoQuU44FKW9g" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Original article ↗</a></header><div class="lux-brand-news-copy"><p>Marca China 2026 will be held on September 8–9 in Hall 1 of the Poly World Trade Center Expo in Guangzhou. The show is expected to cover 10,000 square metres, bring together more than 300 manufacturers and attract over 10,000 professional buyers.</p><section class="lux-reader-section"><h2>Italian National Pavilion</h2><p>A major highlight is the first participation of the Italian Trade Agency with an official Italian National Pavilion, bringing together 10 companies. Products will include extra virgin olive oil, premium coffee, Italian pizza, sauces, cheeses, truffle products, baked snacks, canned vegetables, ready-to-eat meals and household cleaning products.</p><p>Italian companies aim to build closer relationships with Chinese retailers and distributors while exploring customised and differentiated product solutions for the Chinese market.</p><figure class="lux-brand-news-media"><img width="1080" height="530" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/brand-news/marca-italian-pavilion.webp'); ?>" alt="Italian National Pavilion at Marca China 2026"></figure><figure class="lux-brand-news-media"><img width="1080" height="1528" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/brand-news/marca-italian-pavilion-poster.webp'); ?>" alt="Italian National Pavilion poster"></figure></section><section class="lux-reader-section"><h2>Italian Pavilion Exhibitor Profile</h2><p>Booth: 1D04</p><p>Company: LUXUREAT</p><p>LuxurEat combines respect for traditional food culture with an open and innovative approach. We select products based on quality, distinctiveness and traceability, working with qualified partners who share our values and adhere to responsible sourcing and rigorous production standards.</p><figure class="lux-brand-news-media"><img width="1080" height="1053" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/brand-news/marca-luxureat-logo.webp'); ?>" alt="LuxurEat brand mark"></figure></section><section class="lux-reader-section"><h2>Main Products</h2><p>The foundations of LuxurEat are rooted in Italian gastronomic culture, product development and craftsmanship. Most signature products are produced and packaged in Italy; caviar and other premium ingredients are sourced from selected partners in Italy and abroad, balancing authentic Italian flavour with quality and supply flexibility.</p><figure class="lux-brand-news-media"><img width="1080" height="772" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/brand-news/marca-luxureat-sauce.webp'); ?>" alt="LuxurEat truffle sauce products"></figure></section><a class="lux-brand-news-event-link" href="<?php echo esc_url(luxureat_static_url('en/brand', '#event-marca-china-2026')); ?>"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/events/marca-china-2026-poster-160.webp'); ?>" alt=""><span><small>Exhibitions &amp; Events</small><strong>LuxurEat (露意膳) at Marca China 2026</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div>
